WEBVTT

00:00:10.277 --> 00:00:16.550
Holding you and kissing you enough to bask in

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:22.756
Fighting and loving each other enough to bask in

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:28.962
I want to know you, just as you are

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:34.701
But I'm the one who can't just be myself

00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:37.838
I don't understand

00:00:37.838 --> 00:00:40.574
Your heart

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.576
Why is it?

00:00:42.576 --> 00:00:47.214
Are you really a sorceress then?

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.385
I want to hold you

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.988
Alone, I cry

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:59.660
I don't ever want to be alone again

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.997
I want to hold you

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:07.301
With you, I fly

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:15.075
I melt into the emotional voice
that almost seems to be crying

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:21.582
Serenade

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.870
He flew to Krylancelo after all.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.306
Childman!

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.810
Lady Shasutadeji...

00:01:53.914 --> 00:01:55.349
Come on, Hartia.

00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:57.017
Mister Hartia!

00:02:10.631 --> 00:02:16.637
SORCERESS AZalle

00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:20.073
Childman, I wish to speak with you.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:22.776
Speak? I understand.

00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:25.345
Later, in the other room.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:26.747
Now!

00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:28.148
Follow me.

00:02:32.953 --> 00:02:36.523
Ch-Childman is Azalie?!

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.428
No way!

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:47.401
Are you sure it's not a mistake, Shrimp Man?

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:48.635
Yes...

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.203
O lce of Silence!

00:02:50.604 --> 00:02:51.505
Stop!

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.246
It's no mistake.

00:02:59.246 --> 00:03:00.514
But that's...

00:03:00.514 --> 00:03:01.948
| can't believe it!

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:06.286
Azalie tried to kill you
because you found that out, right?

00:03:07.454 --> 00:03:09.956
But... But how?

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.358
White magic.

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.160
That's right.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:18.131
Azalie must have used white magic
to change souls with Childman.

00:03:21.535 --> 00:03:26.506
Which means the real Childman
is Bloody August?!

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:27.874
Since when?

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:29.710
| don't know.

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:32.345
But if I think about it now,

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:35.082
there were numerous times
| thought something was strange.

00:03:36.717 --> 00:03:39.619
The moon tonight is exceptionally beautiful.

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:46.927
The final stroke!

00:03:46.927 --> 00:03:48.729
Verdict of Nonexistence!

00:03:52.199 --> 00:03:53.500
That is...

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:59.706
That suffering is the suffering I've tasted!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:14.621
Azalie must have thought that
Master was trying to kill her,

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:17.657
and so she took those actions, but...

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:22.929
There's no mistake.

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:25.665
Master was trying to save Azalie,

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:29.469
because Master could
use the power of Baltanders

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:33.173
to return Azalie to her true form.

00:04:34.808 --> 00:04:37.177
Then, it's too late?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.882
For Miss Azalie?

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:46.086
And to save Childman who's now
become Bloody August?

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.194
It's possible.

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:55.562
Of course it's possible!

00:04:55.562 --> 00:04:56.763
Master...

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:59.599
As long as we have
the true power of Baltanders,

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.334
they can definitely be saved!

00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:08.141
But are they worth saving?

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.342
What did you say?

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:11.344
Well, aside from Childman,

00:05:11.344 --> 00:05:16.817
is Azalie the kind of person you should
risk your life to save, Orphen?

00:05:16.817 --> 00:05:18.451
What are you saying, Steph?

00:05:18.585 --> 00:05:21.955
You could say the root of all this
is the seed that Azalie sowed.

00:05:21.955 --> 00:05:24.825
She wanted to be the ultimate sorcerer,

00:05:24.825 --> 00:05:27.527
so she used forbidden magic,

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:29.362
and thus became a monster.

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.198
| know that.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.733
| wonder then...

00:05:34.234 --> 00:05:38.705
Hartia, why has Azalie, who became
Childman, returned to the Tower of Fangs?

00:05:38.939 --> 00:05:41.107
Didn't she have some kind of goal?

00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:49.549
Master, no, Azalie will become an Elder
with the elimination of Bloody August.

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:54.487
So in short, she'll be one of the elite
at the Tower of Fangs, right?

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:55.422
Yes...

00:05:55.989 --> 00:05:59.125
So she, Azalie, wants that.

00:05:59.793 --> 00:06:05.966
So Azalie is now trying to kill
Master Childman for her own gain.

00:06:33.026 --> 00:06:36.429
So there is nothing more to say, right?

00:06:39.933 --> 00:06:41.835
It's a simple thing.

00:06:42.202 --> 00:06:47.207
Childman you are to immediately
leave the Tower of Fangs.

00:06:47.507 --> 00:06:50.877
| know not what you are scheming,

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:54.314
but should you leave, I shall forget all.

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:56.983
| will protect your honor.

00:06:58.118 --> 00:07:03.623
As soon as possible, yes,
shall we have you leave tonight?

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:09.029
| shall fabricate a reason
and inform the other elders of it.

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:11.831
So, who shall take my seat?

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:13.767
Your offspring?

00:07:14.334 --> 00:07:16.536
There is no need to answer.

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:18.438
O Wind as a Blade.

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:20.006
Scatter.

00:07:23.944 --> 00:07:29.282
Do you think you could win over me,
an Elder, Childman?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.145
So this is where you've been.

00:08:01.982 --> 00:08:04.217
Dry yourself off. You'll catch cold.

00:08:04.617 --> 00:08:06.786
You just ran off all of a sudden.

00:08:06.786 --> 00:08:08.455
| looked for you.

00:08:09.356 --> 00:08:11.491
Is this supposed to be in return for last time?

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:16.196
It's not just me.

00:08:16.796 --> 00:08:19.666
Majic and Stephanie have been looking too.

00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:22.168
| better let them know I found you.

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:28.174
| didn't know anything
and hated him, hated Childman.

00:08:31.077 --> 00:08:33.413
Did you come to an answer?

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.784
An answer on what to do now.

00:08:38.852 --> 00:08:40.186
I'll convince them.

00:08:40.787 --> 00:08:45.759
If I tell them the truth,
I'm sure they'll understand.

00:08:45.759 --> 00:08:47.761
For sure, Azalie...

00:08:47.761 --> 00:08:49.229
I think it may not be possible.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.799
That's not the kind of person she is.

00:08:52.799 --> 00:08:57.170
Miss Azalie wasn't the kind of person
you thought she was, Orphen.

00:08:57.437 --> 00:08:59.539
Let's think it over with everyone.

00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:04.244
Let's go back to the apartment
with Majic, Stephanie, and Hartia...

00:09:04.711 --> 00:09:07.714
Let's figure out what to do now with everyone.

00:09:07.714 --> 00:09:09.115
Okay, Orphen?

00:09:12.886 --> 00:09:13.920
Now...

00:09:15.822 --> 00:09:18.491
Not that way. The apartment's this way.

00:09:18.491 --> 00:09:19.826
Let me go.

00:09:19.826 --> 00:09:21.061
Not gonna.

00:09:21.461 --> 00:09:22.929
Let me go!

00:09:22.929 --> 00:09:24.864
Let's go back, Orphen!

00:09:24.864 --> 00:09:26.399
Azalie's important to me!

00:09:28.368 --> 00:09:31.004
To me she's more important than anyone!

00:09:31.004 --> 00:09:32.072
Than anyone...

00:09:47.854 --> 00:09:49.055
Orphen...

00:10:00.934 --> 00:10:02.869
Good morning, Mother.

00:10:02.869 --> 00:10:04.637
I've brought you breakfast.

00:10:08.374 --> 00:10:09.542
Mother?

00:10:20.954 --> 00:10:24.057
Mother!

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:34.801
He's here?

00:10:39.239 --> 00:10:40.440
Azalie...

00:10:58.892 --> 00:11:00.393
Krylancelo...

00:11:21.114 --> 00:11:23.216
What's wrong, Krylancelo?

00:11:23.216 --> 00:11:26.052
Hang on. The Tower of Fangs is close by.

00:11:26.052 --> 00:11:28.655
My hands hurt, Azalie.

00:11:36.396 --> 00:11:38.932
You're hands are cold too, Azalie.

00:11:41.334 --> 00:11:42.502
O Light...

00:11:42.936 --> 00:11:45.638
Wow! It's warm!

00:11:51.244 --> 00:11:53.846
Azalie, why did you...

00:11:55.381 --> 00:11:59.352
To become a sorcerer, that was my dream.

00:11:59.819 --> 00:12:02.388
That's why I studied earnestly every day,

00:12:02.388 --> 00:12:07.393
but there was one more thing
just as important.

00:12:11.898 --> 00:12:17.437
My feelings for Childman
grew stronger with the years.

00:12:21.174 --> 00:12:24.377
And then, in the winter
when I was seventeen...

00:12:26.279 --> 00:12:29.215
It was the first time
I'd ever liked anyone so much.

00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:33.353
So I never expected that my love
would not bloom.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:36.289
It would get in the way of
training as a sorcerer.

00:12:36.289 --> 00:12:37.457
Please forget it.

00:12:37.457 --> 00:12:38.858
B-but...

00:12:39.525 --> 00:12:41.694
For what reason have you come here?

00:12:41.694 --> 00:12:45.198
To become a sorcerer, but now...

00:12:45.698 --> 00:12:48.134
You can become an excellent sorcerer.

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:49.936
I'll quit!

00:12:49.936 --> 00:12:52.538
I'll quit training to be a sorcerer!

00:12:52.538 --> 00:12:54.307
I'll quit, so...

00:12:54.307 --> 00:12:58.911
Azalie, what's important to me
is the you that is a sorcerer.

00:13:16.429 --> 00:13:19.098
After that, I changed.

00:13:19.932 --> 00:13:23.836
| endeavored to become
a full sorcerer every day.

00:13:24.304 --> 00:13:28.207
To rise above that, and even higher.

00:13:28.941 --> 00:13:32.412
To catch up to Childman, to rise above him.

00:13:32.412 --> 00:13:35.848
That's all I thought about and lived for.

00:13:36.249 --> 00:13:38.418
My love for Childman...

00:13:41.187 --> 00:13:45.758
But he never opened his heart to me.

00:13:46.726 --> 00:13:51.798
| wanted him to acknowledge me,
so with the Sword of Baltanders...

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:56.035
The Sword of Baltanders!

00:14:06.412 --> 00:14:07.814
Krylancelo...

00:14:17.223 --> 00:14:19.959
But even so he...

00:14:20.326 --> 00:14:22.895
He tried to kill me,
who had become Bloody August!

00:14:22.895 --> 00:14:24.630
For the honor of the Tower of Fangs!

00:14:28.768 --> 00:14:32.505
| was sad... so very sad...

00:14:32.705 --> 00:14:34.207
That's wrong.

00:14:34.207 --> 00:14:38.544
Childman was trying to save you
by using the power of Baltanders.

00:14:42.749 --> 00:14:43.616
Azalie...

00:14:43.616 --> 00:14:45.385
With that sword?

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:47.887
And what are you saying that sword can do?

00:14:47.887 --> 00:14:50.223
Look at me, Krylancelo.

00:14:50.223 --> 00:14:52.225
This is the power of Baltanders!

00:14:52.225 --> 00:14:53.526
This is the magic of that sword!

00:14:53.526 --> 00:14:55.027
You're wrong, Azalie!

00:14:55.027 --> 00:14:58.131
The Sword of Baltanders is
incomplete on its own!

00:14:58.131 --> 00:15:00.233
Coupled with the two other
artifacts of the Heavenly Beings,

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:02.201
its true power comes forth!

00:15:02.201 --> 00:15:04.036
If you use that true power...

00:15:04.237 --> 00:15:06.406
Azalie, we can save you!

00:15:06.406 --> 00:15:08.808
We can return you to your true form!

00:15:09.809 --> 00:15:10.810
Save?

00:15:11.978 --> 00:15:14.781
Even should that story be true,

00:15:14.781 --> 00:15:18.284
| don't think I want to return to
my former form now.

00:15:19.118 --> 00:15:26.359
Krylancelo, I am at a point I could
not have attained had I remained myself.

00:15:26.726 --> 00:15:29.162
| can do this because of Childman's body.

00:15:29.162 --> 00:15:32.565
Because I'm in the body of
this continent's foremost sorcerer.

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:34.233
Azalie!

00:15:34.233 --> 00:15:36.068
And above all else,

00:15:36.068 --> 00:15:40.440
now I am one with the man
whom I love from the depths of my soul.

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:42.341
I'm happy.

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.978
I have all my dreams in my hands!

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:57.223
| am grateful to you, Krylancelo.

00:15:57.824 --> 00:16:02.795
You are the only one who really tried
to return me to my former form.

00:16:02.795 --> 00:16:04.597
Aren't you lonely?

00:16:05.198 --> 00:16:07.900
Aren't you sad living that way?!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.036
You're always a child, aren't you?

00:16:18.077 --> 00:16:20.513
You're too pure.

00:16:20.513 --> 00:16:21.514
But...

00:16:22.114 --> 00:16:24.717
| like you that way...

00:16:27.086 --> 00:16:28.454
Krylancelo.

00:16:38.197 --> 00:16:39.265
Childman?

00:16:46.038 --> 00:16:48.674
Isn't that the Tower of Fangs?

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:51.244
The person you want to see
is over there then?

00:16:51.777 --> 00:16:54.614
Why are you talking to it
like we're not in trouble?!

00:16:54.614 --> 00:16:57.250
That's the den of the super evil sorcerers!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:59.952
What will you do if there's
a danger to our lives?

00:17:00.219 --> 00:17:01.821
It'd be nice if you did get to see them.

00:17:01.821 --> 00:17:04.357
Won't you listen to your
older brother's words of caution?!

00:17:27.013 --> 00:17:28.514
Childman...

00:17:28.514 --> 00:17:29.715
O Light of Destruction!

00:17:35.054 --> 00:17:36.022
Blade-

00:17:36.022 --> 00:17:39.458
Stop! He doesn't want to fight!
Don't you understand?!

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:40.693
Don't get in my way!

00:17:40.693 --> 00:17:43.362
You still don't believe it
after seeing him in such a state?!

00:17:43.362 --> 00:17:45.298
He wasn't trying to kill you!

00:17:45.298 --> 00:17:46.732
He was trying to save you!

00:17:46.732 --> 00:17:47.600
Move!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:48.501
Azalie!

00:17:48.501 --> 00:17:49.502
Move!

00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:51.337
Azalie!

00:17:52.905 --> 00:17:54.106
Hartia?!

00:17:54.407 --> 00:17:56.676
Look at this, Azalie!

00:17:56.676 --> 00:17:57.810
Oh Light!

00:18:10.456 --> 00:18:11.591
This is...

00:18:11.591 --> 00:18:15.094
Master treasured his memories with you!

00:18:15.561 --> 00:18:21.701
He believed he was the one to blame
for the whole Bloody August incident!

00:18:21.701 --> 00:18:25.571
So that when he returned you to your true form,

00:18:27.139 --> 00:18:28.608
he was to...

00:18:31.611 --> 00:18:34.013
Azalie, there's still time.

00:18:35.514 --> 00:18:37.450
I'll return you to your true form!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.386
Childman, and then you.

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:45.591
To me you were a mother, sister...

00:18:47.426 --> 00:18:48.794
and woman!

00:18:49.929 --> 00:18:51.864
| want to save you!

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:54.900
With the whole of my feelings!

00:19:00.673 --> 00:19:02.174
Krylancelo...

00:19:05.077 --> 00:19:06.312
Cleao...

00:19:07.613 --> 00:19:08.914
This is...

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:12.451
You won't die.

00:19:12.918 --> 00:19:14.854
You definitely won't die, right, Orphen?!

00:19:14.854 --> 00:19:17.023
No, I won't die!

00:19:18.924 --> 00:19:19.892
Master!

00:19:30.269 --> 00:19:34.106
| saw Azalie in the inner courtyard today
with her shoulder drooping.

00:19:35.007 --> 00:19:37.176
Maybe some hardship has occurred.

00:19:56.562 --> 00:20:00.332
Today I saw with my eyes how isolated Azalie is.

00:20:01.167 --> 00:20:03.869
The fate of those blessed with genius,

00:20:03.869 --> 00:20:07.506
| pray that she won't give in
to the scars to her soul.

00:20:14.814 --> 00:20:15.815
Orphen!

00:20:16.615 --> 00:20:18.284
Watch, Azalie!

00:20:19.652 --> 00:20:23.255
| will save Azalie, definitely with these hands,

00:20:24.123 --> 00:20:27.727
even if that means I lose my own life.

00:20:30.563 --> 00:20:31.897
Master...

00:20:55.788 --> 00:20:56.856
You are?!

00:21:01.694 --> 00:21:02.762
Stop!

00:21:02.962 --> 00:21:05.464
The Tower of Fangs is mine!

00:21:12.204 --> 00:21:14.807
Mother!

00:21:38.531 --> 00:21:39.865
That can't be.

00:21:39.865 --> 00:21:41.300
That's...

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:43.736
Bloody August is...

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:45.538
Master...

00:21:57.216 --> 00:21:59.852
No!

00:22:15.935 --> 00:22:18.470
| won't accept this conclusion!

00:22:18.737 --> 00:22:20.606
I've made a promise.

00:22:20.606 --> 00:22:22.908
As long as I haven't fulfilled that promise,

00:22:22.908 --> 00:22:25.411
| can't go forward in my heart.

00:22:25.911 --> 00:22:29.348
Now! Now, with the feelings of
these past six years,

00:22:29.348 --> 00:22:33.919
with the whole of my being,
and to the bright new journey!

00:22:33.919 --> 00:22:35.821
Last Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:35.821 --> 00:22:37.756
the end of my Journey
"The End of My Journey."

00:22:37.756 --> 00:22:40.092
The end of my Journey
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:40.960
The end of my Journey

00:22:42.628 --> 00:22:44.163
What should I do?

00:22:44.163 --> 00:22:46.565
I need you to come after me

00:22:46.565 --> 00:22:50.803
Even if I just kept on walking

00:22:52.371 --> 00:22:53.939
What should I do?

00:22:53.939 --> 00:22:56.375
We wouldn't be able to meet

00:22:56.375 --> 00:23:00.679
Even if we knew each other's cell phone numbers

00:23:01.247 --> 00:23:06.118
Headlights illuminate me

00:23:06.118 --> 00:23:10.422
They're too bright, so I close my eyes

00:23:11.056 --> 00:23:13.459
If I kick my high heels off

00:23:13.459 --> 00:23:15.928
And hold them in both hands

00:23:15.928 --> 00:23:21.000
I could even throw away my pride

00:23:21.166 --> 00:23:29.742
For the first time, I feel like
I might do something really unfair

00:23:30.943 --> 00:23:41.620
I just want to collapse on the street and cry

00:23:42.554 --> 00:23:47.059
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:47.793 --> 00:23:51.997
Because I'm not really so strong

00:23:52.731 --> 00:23:56.802
If you kissed me right now

00:23:57.603 --> 00:24:02.241
I'd cry, what should I do?

